            <ArticleTitle>[Prognostic value of cardiac function parameters after aortocoronary bypass].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>73-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A method of quantitative assessment of the severity of patients' condition and the risk involved in aortocoronary shunting is proposed on the basis of mathematical treatment of noninvasive investigation data in 127 coronary patients. Six groups of patients with different degrees of surgical risk are identified.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
